        "Description": "We are begginging to detect ECTOGEN operations. Jason Portman is the founders adopted nephew. He is both a manager for a old ECTOGEN lab but is also a drug lord in need of a vaction. Hilde Sorbetto is a top investor in ECTOGEN and will do anything to make a profit. Finally, Dr. Singh is a former staff member of the recently closed GAMA Hospital &amp; Hotel. We have identfied these three ECTOGEN members enjoying a vaction in the Maldives. Let&apos;s ruin it.",
